{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7f270c353cc7a151adba7bb346ed6194.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/e9b181684006f3eb778fa959b2a6debc.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/e9b181684006f3eb778fa959b2a6debc.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/e9b181684006f3eb778fa959b2a6debc.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A school life spent with cute and beautiful girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the \u201cAncient Prehistoric Civilization Central Intelligence Executive Agency,\u201d Hart Grancer is a former boy mercenary who has infiltrated the \u201cAcademy,\u201d a.k.a. the teaching institution of the subordinate organization.<br>He is assigned to teach a group of girls who have some mysterious reason to be there, as well as to take on assignments from the Administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a new mission comes along - the discovery and recovery of the &quot;Grimforge.&quot;<br>But that was also the beginning of a huge conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/4c825818db0eecf08710cabbbb9c37be.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d299063f4acbb86d4394700a64ff2fb5.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d299063f4acbb86d4394700a64ff2fb5.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d299063f4acbb86d4394700a64ff2fb5.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: October 12 / Height: 156 cm / Weapon: Darts and thrusting sword / Hometown: 7th Precinct, Moomoo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very ordinary girl who is bright and likes pretty things.<br>She is a hard worker, but sometimes feels inferior to the talented people around her.<br>While everything is normal, she only has big boobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5724e5bba481d4bbc5a31e1a5afb8687.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5724e5bba481d4bbc5a31e1a5afb8687.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5724e5bba481d4bbc5a31e1a5afb8687.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: August 15 / Height: 156 cm / Weapon: Gun / Sword / Hometown: Imperial City of Invoa</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the third daughter of a former noble family and is very proud.<br>Contrary to her haughty attitude, she is weak and easily puts on airs when she is coaxed.<br>She likes glittering and flashy things.<br>She speaks the family motto without being asked to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/769b01c4d1849be8d3ee13289822bbc7.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/769b01c4d1849be8d3ee13289822bbc7.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/769b01c4d1849be8d3ee13289822bbc7.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: February 4 / Height: 141 cm / Weapon: Yoyo / Hometown: Tajine, 212th precinct</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is energetic, lively, and very active.<br>She looks small and has a childlike personality, but she is older than the other children around her and acts like a big sister.<br>She is very sensitive when her head is patted.<br>She likes to put stickers on people, calling them \u2018certified\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f0ce3593d513e7de16abcf2abf59d5bb.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f0ce3593d513e7de16abcf2abf59d5bb.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f0ce3593d513e7de16abcf2abf59d5bb.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: March 3 / Height: 151 cm / Weapon: None / Hometown: 351st Precinct, Caldoverde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a quiet girl who seems to be in the corner reading a book.<br>She is shy and is not good at communicating or being in a crowd.<br>She hides behind her clothes, but she actually has big tits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/873b3f375f6a6f1dbfd4f6cbefc98d14.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/873b3f375f6a6f1dbfd4f6cbefc98d14.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/873b3f375f6a6f1dbfd4f6cbefc98d14.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: May 3 / Height: 141 cm / Weapon: Railgun blade / Birthplace: unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a pouty girl who is hard to see her emotions, but inside she is surprisingly passionate and sweet-natured.<br>She easily misses animals, and Selene loves them too.<br>She is small in stature but has a toned body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/52650b6673d8086ce3b52ecdf091ba85.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/52650b6673d8086ce3b52ecdf091ba85.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/52650b6673d8086ce3b52ecdf091ba85.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: January 18 / Height: 158 cm / Weapon: stun rods and large pistols / Hometown: 81st precinct, Yamato</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very serious committee chairperson type.<br>She is so versatile that girls would adore her, and she has breasts and a great style.<br>Don't tell everyone, but she actually secretly writes light novels (love stories).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/8c65b2571d9e08a0b0b2bad411442faf.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/237770585aa1bb7a3660af6c1c0f536b.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;fragments&quot; scattered throughout the world are silent witnesses to the pain of a forgotten age.<br>Whenever the girls reach for them, they find themselves suspended between what was and what\u2019s to come.<br>Within the pulse of life, feelings take root\u2014and choices must be made.<br>A single story begins, shaped by prayers and sins alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the \u201cAncient Prehistoric Civilization Central Intelligence Executive Agency,\u201d Hart Grancer is a former boy mercenary who has infiltrated the \u201cAcademy,\u201d a.k.a. the teaching institution of the subordinate organization. <br>He is assigned to teach a group of girls who have some mysterious reason to be there, as well as to take on assignments from the Administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a new mission comes along - the discovery and recovery of the &quot;Grimforge.&quot; <br>But that was also the beginning of a huge conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f436998a1494854b3470249d0b5f815c.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f436998a1494854b3470249d0b5f815c.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f436998a1494854b3470249d0b5f815c.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5020cf0e87fd9f4ea8c6fb63c437da51.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the bustling days, a quiet pause gently appears.<br>There, you\u2019ll see a gesture they usually hide, or a smile that escapes before they notice.<br>Moments that quietly bring you closer to the girls\u2014<br>a fleeting promise of a future not yet named.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/da713337f771cec01c5b30cf6169c279.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/650876800d69c1d128ece17a75120d01.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cards that reflect the personalities and skills of your friends to win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d7669593baa38b6d2b2b40d310033bbc.avif?t=1757642269\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f1d9e5d1fcb2f9c87b45abc92f1a0296.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards are added to your hand by your actions in battle.<br>Do you take the best action now?\u3000Or prepare for the next battle?<br>Watch for opportunities and build your deck during battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/2422f2f8e0de63caa90f718c4f15be27.avif?t=1757642269\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/8026008e2429dae1b8fcbc0740a3c20d.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cArtifacts\u201d can be equipped to compensate for weaknesses or develop more individuality.<br>Strengthen your favorite character as much as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, artifacts can be synthesized!<br>You can create new artifacts that inherit your desired abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/94a26815f20aa2c93edcb753ac1c2de0.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/ad43d8168d20587ebd8739f6c310ff6e.avif?t=1757642269\" width=300 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Project.L.A</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Developer's Comment\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I found myself getting together. We found ourselves making it.<br>Battles, drama, friendship, and a little bit of crying-- <br>We packed it all into this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Some in-game screenshots on the store page include content still in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412860?t=1757642269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412860?t=1757642269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/cdf3fe2193c03334364cd94dd645ae5f37561446/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757642269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/cdf3fe2193c03334364cd94dd645ae5f37561446/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757642269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7f270c353cc7a151adba7bb346ed6194.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/e9b181684006f3eb778fa959b2a6debc.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/e9b181684006f3eb778fa959b2a6debc.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/e9b181684006f3eb778fa959b2a6debc.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A school life spent with cute and beautiful girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the \u201cAncient Prehistoric Civilization Central Intelligence Executive Agency,\u201d Hart Grancer is a former boy mercenary who has infiltrated the \u201cAcademy,\u201d a.k.a. the teaching institution of the subordinate organization.<br>He is assigned to teach a group of girls who have some mysterious reason to be there, as well as to take on assignments from the Administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a new mission comes along - the discovery and recovery of the &quot;Grimforge.&quot;<br>But that was also the beginning of a huge conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/4c825818db0eecf08710cabbbb9c37be.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d299063f4acbb86d4394700a64ff2fb5.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d299063f4acbb86d4394700a64ff2fb5.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d299063f4acbb86d4394700a64ff2fb5.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: October 12 / Height: 156 cm / Weapon: Darts and thrusting sword / Hometown: 7th Precinct, Moomoo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very ordinary girl who is bright and likes pretty things.<br>She is a hard worker, but sometimes feels inferior to the talented people around her.<br>While everything is normal, she only has big boobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5724e5bba481d4bbc5a31e1a5afb8687.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5724e5bba481d4bbc5a31e1a5afb8687.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5724e5bba481d4bbc5a31e1a5afb8687.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: August 15 / Height: 156 cm / Weapon: Gun / Sword / Hometown: Imperial City of Invoa</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the third daughter of a former noble family and is very proud.<br>Contrary to her haughty attitude, she is weak and easily puts on airs when she is coaxed.<br>She likes glittering and flashy things.<br>She speaks the family motto without being asked to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/769b01c4d1849be8d3ee13289822bbc7.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/769b01c4d1849be8d3ee13289822bbc7.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/769b01c4d1849be8d3ee13289822bbc7.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: February 4 / Height: 141 cm / Weapon: Yoyo / Hometown: Tajine, 212th precinct</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is energetic, lively, and very active.<br>She looks small and has a childlike personality, but she is older than the other children around her and acts like a big sister.<br>She is very sensitive when her head is patted.<br>She likes to put stickers on people, calling them \u2018certified\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f0ce3593d513e7de16abcf2abf59d5bb.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f0ce3593d513e7de16abcf2abf59d5bb.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f0ce3593d513e7de16abcf2abf59d5bb.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: March 3 / Height: 151 cm / Weapon: None / Hometown: 351st Precinct, Caldoverde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a quiet girl who seems to be in the corner reading a book.<br>She is shy and is not good at communicating or being in a crowd.<br>She hides behind her clothes, but she actually has big tits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/873b3f375f6a6f1dbfd4f6cbefc98d14.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/873b3f375f6a6f1dbfd4f6cbefc98d14.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/873b3f375f6a6f1dbfd4f6cbefc98d14.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: May 3 / Height: 141 cm / Weapon: Railgun blade / Birthplace: unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a pouty girl who is hard to see her emotions, but inside she is surprisingly passionate and sweet-natured.<br>She easily misses animals, and Selene loves them too.<br>She is small in stature but has a toned body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/52650b6673d8086ce3b52ecdf091ba85.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/52650b6673d8086ce3b52ecdf091ba85.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/52650b6673d8086ce3b52ecdf091ba85.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Birthday: January 18 / Height: 158 cm / Weapon: stun rods and large pistols / Hometown: 81st precinct, Yamato</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very serious committee chairperson type.<br>She is so versatile that girls would adore her, and she has breasts and a great style.<br>Don't tell everyone, but she actually secretly writes light novels (love stories).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/8c65b2571d9e08a0b0b2bad411442faf.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/237770585aa1bb7a3660af6c1c0f536b.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;fragments&quot; scattered throughout the world are silent witnesses to the pain of a forgotten age.<br>Whenever the girls reach for them, they find themselves suspended between what was and what\u2019s to come.<br>Within the pulse of life, feelings take root\u2014and choices must be made.<br>A single story begins, shaped by prayers and sins alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the \u201cAncient Prehistoric Civilization Central Intelligence Executive Agency,\u201d Hart Grancer is a former boy mercenary who has infiltrated the \u201cAcademy,\u201d a.k.a. the teaching institution of the subordinate organization. <br>He is assigned to teach a group of girls who have some mysterious reason to be there, as well as to take on assignments from the Administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day, a new mission comes along - the discovery and recovery of the &quot;Grimforge.&quot; <br>But that was also the beginning of a huge conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f436998a1494854b3470249d0b5f815c.poster.avif?t=1757642269\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f436998a1494854b3470249d0b5f815c.webm?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f436998a1494854b3470249d0b5f815c.mp4?t=1757642269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/5020cf0e87fd9f4ea8c6fb63c437da51.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the bustling days, a quiet pause gently appears.<br>There, you\u2019ll see a gesture they usually hide, or a smile that escapes before they notice.<br>Moments that quietly bring you closer to the girls\u2014<br>a fleeting promise of a future not yet named.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/da713337f771cec01c5b30cf6169c279.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/650876800d69c1d128ece17a75120d01.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cards that reflect the personalities and skills of your friends to win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/d7669593baa38b6d2b2b40d310033bbc.avif?t=1757642269\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/f1d9e5d1fcb2f9c87b45abc92f1a0296.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards are added to your hand by your actions in battle.<br>Do you take the best action now?\u3000Or prepare for the next battle?<br>Watch for opportunities and build your deck during battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/2422f2f8e0de63caa90f718c4f15be27.avif?t=1757642269\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/8026008e2429dae1b8fcbc0740a3c20d.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cArtifacts\u201d can be equipped to compensate for weaknesses or develop more individuality.<br>Strengthen your favorite character as much as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, artifacts can be synthesized!<br>You can create new artifacts that inherit your desired abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/1959c576cfc1abccac7078df80c837d8.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/94a26815f20aa2c93edcb753ac1c2de0.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/ad43d8168d20587ebd8739f6c310ff6e.avif?t=1757642269\" width=300 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Project.L.A</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Developer's Comment\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I found myself getting together. We found ourselves making it.<br>Battles, drama, friendship, and a little bit of crying-- <br>We packed it all into this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412860/extras/7d5805c53a21f70a59e246092a8ed469.avif?t=1757642269\" data-has-big width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Some in-game screenshots on the store page include content still in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Project.L.A"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"descript